                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Poetry"
            },
            {
                "id": "ref128",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Verse using laydown source: spacing commands and a break command for lineation."
            },
            {
                "id": "ref129",
                "type": "h2",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Poetry"
            },
            {
                "id": "ref130",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Laydown in <code>source</code>. Commands keep the count inside the brackets: space-count for indent, hyphen, dot, underscore, tilde, pipe, equals; backslash-count for a new line (<code>[\\1]</code>) or stanza (<code>[\\3]</code>). Enter in Studio inserts <code>[\\1]</code>. Markdown bold and italic apply per line. Block type: <code>poetry</code>."
            },
            {
                "id": "ref131",
                "type": "poetry",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "source": "***The sea*** *does not* *remember*[\\1]\nmy name, though it repeats[\\1]\nit every night[\\1]\nlike a tide",
                "sourceExpanded": false
            },
            {
                "id": "ref132",
                "type": "h1",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Math"
            },
            {
                "id": "ref133",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Equations using MathML source stored on the block."
            },
            {
                "id": "ref134",
                "type": "h2",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Math (MathML)"
            },
            {
                "id": "ref135",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "text": "Equations and formulas; <code>source</code> holds MathML, <code>display</code> toggles block layout. Block type: <code>mathml</code>."
            },
            {
                "id": "ref136",
                "type": "mathml",
                "align": "left",
                "theme": null,
                "cols": 2,
                "source": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n  <mrow>\n    <mi>E</mi>\n    <mo>=</mo>\n    <mi>m</mi>\n    <msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup>\n  </mrow>\n</math>",
                "display": true,
                "sourceExpanded": false
            },
            {
                "id": "ref137",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "align": "left",
